<title>THAILAND: Ayudhya Insurance Q3 net profit up.</title>
<headline>Ayudhya Insurance Q3 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the first nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 7.71			6.81</p>
<p>    Net			192.81		    170.15</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		19.05     vs	    17.15</p>
<p>    Net			476.22     vs	   428.74</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Ayudhya Insurance Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
